-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח ג': the work-week table of a teacher
-- under the reform in full, by his frontal hours (§13(א) sends a part-time
-- teacher to it); the 60-minute hour of its presence; its notes on frontal
-- hours that are not whole and on fewer than 4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g1`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g2`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g3`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b1`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b2`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b3`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-a`

§ `נספח ג'`

-- The title ("טבלאות שבוע עבודה למורים ביישום מלא של הרפורמה") and the
-- table: a teacher under the reform in full, from the full position of 24
-- frontal, 6 individual and 10 teaching-support hours (§9(ו), as §13
-- holds it) down to 4 frontal hours, a frontal hour less a column.
@ref akn:att_9__hc_1/p1 akn:att_9__hc_1/t1
`the table of annex ג'` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ג'"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band under 50`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 24 6 10 40,
            `an Oz annexed column` (96.25%) 23 6 9.5 38.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (91.25%) 22 5.5 9 36.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (87.50%) 21 5 9 35,
            `an Oz annexed column` (83.75%) 20 5 8.5 33.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (78.75%) 19 4.5 8 31.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (75.00%) 18 4.5 7.5 30,
            `an Oz annexed column` (71.25%) 17 4.5 7 28.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (66.25%) 16 4 6.5 26.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (62.50%) 15 4 6 25,
            `an Oz annexed column` (58.75%) 14 3.5 6 23.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (53.75%) 13 3 5.5 21.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 12 3 5 20,
            `an Oz annexed column` (46.25%) 11 3 4.5 18.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (41.25%) 10 2.5 4 16.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (37.50%) 9 2.5 3.5 15,
            `an Oz annexed column` (33.75%) 8 2 3.5 13.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (28.75%) 7 1.5 3 11.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (25.00%) 6 1.5 2.5 10,
            `an Oz annexed column` (21.25%) 5 1.5 2 8.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (18.25%) 4 1 1.5 6.5

-- The asterisk under the table: the presence is in hours of 60 minutes
-- (§9(יא)), which changes nothing in the length of a teaching period as
-- the Ministry of Education set it.
@ref akn:att_9__hc_1/p2
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz annexed column`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of presence a column of annex ג' asks` c IS
    `the minutes of weekly presence` (`the annexed column's week` c)

`the presence in annex ג' changes the length of a teaching period` MEANS FALSE

-- The first note: frontal and role hours that are not whole take the
-- individual and support hours of the column nearest to them, and the
-- position is all the hours over the full position's (common: `the week
-- the annexed table gives`, `the position of the week in the annexed
-- table`). It points to "נספח ג'" — itself — for an example, and prints
-- none.
@ref akn:att_9__hc_1/p3
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what the table of annex ג' gives for` f IS
    `what the annexed table gives for` `the table of annex ג'` f

-- The second note: a teacher with fewer than 4 frontal hours (with his
-- homeroom and role hours) works frontal hours only, his position his
-- hours over "בסיס המשרה ברפורמה" — §9(א)'s 40 hours, the table's own full
-- position. "בפחות מ-4" leaves 4 out; the table's last column is 4.
@ref akn:att_9__hc_1/p4
`the fewest frontal hours annex ג' keeps whole` MEANS 4

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER @desc frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex ג' gives a teacher with` f IS
    `what the annexed table gives, frontal hours only below` `the table of annex ג'` `the fewest frontal hours annex ג' keeps whole` f

§§ `נספח ג' -- the checks`

-- The table opens at the full position, and its columns step down a
-- frontal hour at a time.
#ASSERT `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ג'`
#ASSERT `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ג'`
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ג'` EQUALS `the fewest frontal hours annex ג' keeps whole`

-- Its arithmetic: every presence is its column's hours, and every position
-- its hours over the 40 — but the last: 4 frontal, 1 individual and 1.5
-- teaching-support hours, 6.5 hours, are 16.25% of 40, and the column
-- prints 18.25% (F-oz-founding-annex-g-a; the hours decide).
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ג'` EQUALS LIST
    `the cell of` `the table of annex ג'` `the position row` 21 (18.25%)
#ASSERT `what annex ג' gives a teacher with` 4 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 4 1 1.5) (16.25%) (16.25%))

-- F-oz-founding-annex-g-a: every table of annexes א'–ג'3 is held to the
-- same arithmetic, which the notes under them state, and the twelve
-- annexes' 36 printed tables depart from it in 14 cells (pinned in each
-- annex's file): the 18.25% above; annex ג'1's presence of 18; annex
-- ב'3's first column over 55, whose 6 individual hours make it 33 hours
-- against its own 32 and its 100%; the presence printed above 29, 28 and
-- 24 in annex א'1's (ב) table under 50, 31, 30, 28 and 27 in annex א'2's,
-- and 35 in annex א'3's, where the hours make the half hour below and the
-- (א) table printing the same week prints it; and annex א's (א) table over
-- 55, whose presence prints 31 and 29.5 for weeks of 30.5 and 29 hours.
-- The hours decide (convention reading.misprint).
`the printed tables of annexes א'–ג'3` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        map (GIVEN m YIELD m's `the table under (א)`) `the mother's tables of annexes א'–א'3`,
        map (GIVEN m YIELD m's `the table under (ב)`) `the mother's tables of annexes א'–א'3`,
        LIST `the table of annex ב' from 50 to 55`, `the table of annex ב' over 55`,
             `the table of annex ב'1 from 50 to 55`, `the table of annex ב'1 over 55`,
             `the table of annex ב'2 from 50 to 55`, `the table of annex ב'2 over 55`,
             `the table of annex ב'3 from 50 to 55`, `the table of annex ב'3 over 55`,
             `the table of annex ג'`, `the table of annex ג'1`, `the table of annex ג'2`, `the table of annex ג'3`)

`the annexed tables print cells off their own arithmetic` MEANS
        count `the printed tables of annexes א'–ג'3` EQUALS 36
    AND count (concat (map `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the printed tables of annexes א'–ג'3`)) EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `the annexed tables print cells off their own arithmetic`
#ASSERT all `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the printed tables of annexes א'–ג'3`
#ASSERT all `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the printed tables of annexes א'–ג'3`

§§ `נספח ג' -- illustrations`

-- 23 frontal hours: the second column, 96.25%.
#ASSERT `what annex ג' gives a teacher with` 23 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 23 6 9.5) (96.25%) (96.25%))
-- 20.5 frontal hours, by the first note: the column of 21 (a half goes
-- up), 5 individual and 9 support hours, 34.5 hours of 40, 86.25%.
#ASSERT `what annex ג' gives a teacher with` 20.5 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 20.5 5 9) (86.25%) (86.25%))
-- 3 frontal hours, by the second: frontal hours only, 3 of 40.
#ASSERT `what annex ג' gives a teacher with` 3 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 3 0 0) (7.5%) (7.5%))
-- 3.6 hours are fewer than 4, though the nearest column is 4's.
#ASSERT `what annex ג' gives a teacher with` 3.6 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 3.6 0 0) (9%) (9%))
#ASSERT `the minutes of presence a column of annex ג' asks` (`an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 24 6 10 40) EQUALS 2400
#ASSERT NOT `the presence in annex ג' changes the length of a teaching period`
